<title>UK: Seibu Dept Stores sets $90 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Seibu Dept Stores sets $90 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DKB International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THE SEIBU DEPARTMENT STORES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE DAI-ICHI KANGYO BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $90 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    09.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +20 BP    PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.30</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) 50	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
